# Review routing for the security-relevant configuration in this repository.
#
# This file is also the approver registry for .circleci/security-waivers.yaml:
# validate-waivers refuses an accepted-risk entry whose `approved-by` does not
# resolve to an owner listed here, so an acceptance cannot be self-granted by
# an account with no stake in the file it waives.
#
# NOTE: require_code_owner_review is deliberately NOT requested on the branch
# protection for main. GitHub does not count a PR author's own approval, so a
# sole security owner would deadlock their own security PRs. Routing here is
# for visibility, not for blocking.

